# Production secrets for the Fly API — filled from .env.prod.example, imported with
# `make secrets-prod` (server/Makefile). NEVER commit this file; the guard below is what stops
# a stray `git add -A` from shipping live credentials. The `.example` template IS committed.
.env.prod
.env.prod.*
!.env.prod.example

